### Cadastro: cria conta e devolve um token
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/cadastro/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "adam",
  "password": "Pass1234!",
  "user_cpf": "12345678901",
  "user_nickname": "adam",
  "first_name": "Adam",
  "last_name": "Silva",
  "email": "adam@mail.com",
  "user_age": 25
}

### Login: usa as credenciais da conta cadastrada
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "adam",
  "password": "Pass1234!"
}

### Teste protegido: substitua o valor pelo token recebido no cadastro/login
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/teste_token/
Authorization: Token d50c5fe82cd964d499037a453f83ff7bc4d7c83e
